    "Input: X = [[1.0, 0.0], [0.0, 1.0], [1.0, 1.0]], y = [0, 1, 2], num_classes = 3, lr = 0.1, epochs = 5\n\nOutput: {\"weights\": [[0.0556, -0.1075, 0.052], [-0.1075, 0.0556, 0.052]], \"train_accuracy\": 1.0}\n\nExplanation: Evaluated ml_softmax_regression under standard test conditions."
